claim.claim-text:
detect an access pattern and a shared local memory banking architecture for each of the plurality of thread groups;
generate shared local memory tiling for each thread group based at least in part on the detected access pattern and the shared local memory banking architecture for the thread group; and
apply the generated shared local memory tiling for each thread group for data stored in the shared local memory.

detecting an access pattern and a shared local memory banking architecture for each of a plurality of thread groups, wherein processing of a machine learning algorithm includes processing of the plurality of thread groups, each thread group including a plurality of processing threads;
generating tiling for a shared local memory for each thread group based at least in part on the detected access pattern and the shared local memory banking architecture for the thread group; and
applying the generated shared local memory tiling for each thread group for data stored in the shared local memory.

detect an access pattern and a shared local memory banking architecture for each of a plurality of thread groups, wherein processing of a machine learning algorithm includes processing of the plurality of thread groups, each thread group including a plurality of processing threads;
generate tiling for a shared local memory for each thread group based at least in part on the detected access pattern and the shared local memory banking architecture for the thread group; and
apply the generated shared local memory tiling for each thread group for data stored in the shared local memory.
